msgid ""
"Read the relevant contract and adjacent README before changing behavior. "
"Select only maintained modes, keep private provider/vendor types out of "
"consumers, and update declarations, diagrams, examples and translations "
"together when their meaning changes. Preserve original evidence bytes and "
"scope instead of renaming historical results to current HEAD."
msgstr ""
"改变行为前，阅读相应合同与相邻 "
"README。只选择维护模式，消费工程不接触私有提供者／厂商类型；含义变化时同时更新声明、图示、示例和翻译。保留原证据字节与范围，不能把历史结果改名为当前"
" HEAD。"
